{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time for a Monday Meltdown. A solo-developed, super-fast 8-player top-down shooter built for one thing: <strong>dominating</strong> <strong>your</strong> <strong>friends</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Hotline Miami</i> and <i>Soldat</i>, and spiced up with plenty of gore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/04daf791e7d2decdd5124843b61f690d.avif?t=1770664578\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate</strong> your <strong>friends</strong> or foes in a variety of fast-paced gamemodes. Host or join a match and you're straight into the action\u2014no waiting around. Got no friends? Bots are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/29f6f22cc2ec5be59c2facb5c15fa74b.avif?t=1770664578\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with a wide range of <strong>weapons</strong>\u00a0that all serve a specific purpose -\u00a0<strong>Good</strong> <strong>plays</strong> win the game, not just the gear you're holding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're on a killing-spree,<strong> killstreak</strong>\u00a0weapons will be awarded ensuring chaos unfolds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/b3a6910a2037286e9a71002d82abca1e.avif?t=1770664578\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras_big/b3a6910a2037286e9a71002d82abca1e.webp?t=1770664578 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is cool, but winning with <strong>style</strong> is better. Unlock new character and weapon skins to look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add salt with <strong>taunts and custom killphrases</strong>, or hunt for <strong>cool in-game secrets</strong> to unlock exclusive skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are your ready to melt some Mondays?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First run (hey thanks haha)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512160/4857537dde9188ad1f987e5ea4bd142fa0fa2bcd.jpg"},{"name":"First win!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512160/c272d8629f1415c02adc5e601ab854879cf49adb.jpg"},{"name":"Biggie's Deeds!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512160/aef7ea1ec97a46847655e8a6d071ec31fda15536.jpg"},{"name":"So anyway I started blasting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512160/ed8816808f4131c0851cdd3ddd6a08a4cba7f85c.jpg"},{"name":"Use your first killstreak!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512160/be31223998b297bf69c1c128eb413bf7d1c712a5.jpg"},{"name":"Hammertime!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512160/73afd182ec34247a784ebc521decf359df32823c.jpg"},{"name":"I AM SPEED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic